================================================================================
  KAFKA SCHEMA REGISTRY - SPRING BOOT REFERENCE IMPLEMENTATION
================================================================================

  An event-driven microservice demonstrating Avro serialization, Confluent
  Schema Registry, and safe schema evolution across an independently deployed
  Kafka producer and consumer.

  Java 21  |  Spring Boot 3.5.6  |  Confluent 8.0.0  |  Avro 1.11.4  |  PostgreSQL
  License: MIT

